Package: cromite
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://www.cromite.org/
Depends: @DEPENDS@, ca-certificates, xdg-utils, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6
Recommends: fonts-liberation, libgtk-3-0t64, libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd
Suggests: libqt5widgets5t64, libqt6widgets6, libva2, libpulse0
X-Build-Inputs-SHA256: @BUILD_INPUTS_SHA256@
X-Publisher-Stream: @PUBLISHER_STREAM@
Description: Cromite web browser (official Linux binaries)
 Unofficial Debian 13 packaging of the stable Cromite browser.
 Includes upstream graphics components and receives updates through APT.
